---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { resolvePath } from '../../lib/paths';
import '../../styles/project.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Proposal · Project"
  description="Project proposal for developing an autonomous multi-agent framework for aircraft lightning simulation and surrogate acceleration."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-24">

    <!-- ===== Navigation Breadcrumb ===== -->
    <nav class="mb-10" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-reveal="1">
      <a
        href={resolvePath('/project')}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-solar hover:text-solar-light transition-colors"
        style="border-bottom:none;"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to Project Timeline
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- ===== Header ===== -->
    <header class="project-detail-header" data-reveal="1">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold leading-[1.25] pb-3 mb-2">
        Project Proposal
      </h1>

      <p class="text-solar-light text-xl font-sans font-light max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Autonomous AI Agents for Multi-Fidelity Aircraft Lightning Simulation
      </p>

      <time class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-void-400 block">
        February 2025
      </time>
    </header>

    <!-- ===== Content Sections ===== -->
    <article class="space-y-12 mt-10" data-reveal="2">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          1. Core Hypothesis &amp; Objectives
        </h2>
        <p>
          Conventional computational fluid dynamics (CFD) and plasma simulations require intensive human-in-the-loop tuning: meshing quality checks, CFL condition monitoring, boundary condition tweaks, and post-strike damage diagnostics.
        </p>
        <p>
          We hypothesize that a coordinated team of LLM-powered engineering agents equipped with domain-specific tool access can autonomously:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
          <div class="border border-solar/20 bg-void-950/70 p-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar block mb-1">OBJECTIVE 1</span>
            <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-white block text-base">Adaptive Solver Steering</span>
            <p class="text-void-300 text-sm mt-2 mb-0">
              Detect ionization front velocities and automatically invoke localized grid refinement and time-step adaptation without human intervention.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-solar/20 bg-void-950/70 p-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar block mb-1">OBJECTIVE 2</span>
            <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-white block text-base">Surrogate Model Integration</span>
            <p class="text-void-300 text-sm mt-2 mb-0">
              Route routine ambient field calculations to neural operators while reserving expensive PDE solvers for nonlinear arc formation zones.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Agent Architecture Diagram Embedding -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          2. Multi-Agent System Architecture
        </h2>
        <p>
          The system operates as a hierarchical graph of specialized agents interacting through structured tool calls and shared memory:
        </p>

        <!-- Embedded Interactive Architecture Diagram -->
        <div class="project-sandbox-frame">
          <div class="project-sandbox-frame__header">
            <span>Agent Interaction Topology (Embedded Graph)</span>
            <span class="text-void-400 font-mono text-[10px]">DIRECTED ACYCLIC GRAPH</span>
          </div>

          <div class="w-full bg-void-950 p-4 overflow-x-auto">
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 760 300"
              fill="none"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              class="w-full h-auto min-w-[600px]"
            >
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="agentConnGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ffb84d" />
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ff6633" />
                </linearGradient>
                <filter id="propGlow">
                  <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="2" result="blur" />
                  <feMerge>
                    <feMergeNode in="blur" />
                    <feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic" />
                  </feMerge>
                </filter>
              </defs>

              <!-- Grid background -->
              <line x1="380" y1="20" x2="380" y2="280" stroke="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.1)" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
              <line x1="40" y1="150" x2="720" y2="150" stroke="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.1)" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />

              <!-- Connection Lines -->
              <path d="M 170,150 L 260,150" stroke="url(#agentConnGrad)" stroke-width="2" />
              <path d="M 380,110 L 380,65 L 480,65" stroke="url(#agentConnGrad)" stroke-width="2" />
              <path d="M 380,190 L 380,235 L 480,235" stroke="url(#agentConnGrad)" stroke-width="2" />
              <path d="M 600,65 L 660,110" stroke="url(#agentConnGrad)" stroke-width="1.5" />
              <path d="M 600,235 L 660,190" stroke="url(#agentConnGrad)" stroke-width="1.5" />

              <!-- Feedback loop back to orchestrator -->
              <path d="M 680,120 C 680,30 380,30 380,100" stroke="#ff9c1a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" fill="none" opacity="0.6" />

              <!-- Node 1: Input / Geometry Agent -->
              <g transform="translate(60, 115)">
                <rect width="110" height="70" fill="#140f0a" stroke="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.4)" stroke-width="1" />
                <rect width="110" height="18" fill="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.1)" />
                <text x="55" y="13" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffb84d" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600">INPUT / CAD</text>
                <text x="55" y="38" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0e8dc" font-family="'Sora', sans-serif" font-size="10">Geometry Agent</text>
                <text x="55" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a8a890" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8">Airframe mesh prep</text>
              </g>

              <!-- Central Node: Orchestrator Agent -->
              <g transform="translate(260, 100)">
                <rect width="150" height="100" fill="#1b1208" stroke="#ff9c1a" stroke-width="2" filter="url(#propGlow)" />
                <rect width="150" height="22" fill="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.2)" />
                <text x="75" y="16" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff5e0" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">CORE ORCHESTRATOR</text>
                <text x="75" y="46" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffb84d" font-family="'Sora', sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600">Supervisor Agent</text>
                <text x="75" y="66" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0e8dc" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">Workflow state machine</text>
                <text x="75" y="82" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a8a890" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">Resource &amp; cost alloc</text>
              </g>

              <!-- Node 3: High-Fidelity Physics Solver (Top) -->
              <g transform="translate(480, 30)">
                <rect width="130" height="70" fill="#140f0a" stroke="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.4)" stroke-width="1" />
                <rect width="130" height="18" fill="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.1)" />
                <text x="65" y="13" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffb84d" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600">HIGH-FIDELITY</text>
                <text x="65" y="38" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0e8dc" font-family="'Sora', sans-serif" font-size="10">Plasma Solver Agent</text>
                <text x="65" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a8a890" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8">MHD / Maxwell tools</text>
              </g>

              <!-- Node 4: Neural Surrogate Agent (Bottom) -->
              <g transform="translate(480, 200)">
                <rect width="130" height="70" fill="#140f0a" stroke="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.4)" stroke-width="1" />
                <rect width="130" height="18" fill="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.1)" />
                <text x="65" y="13" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffb84d" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600">FAST SURROGATE</text>
                <text x="65" y="38" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0e8dc" font-family="'Sora', sans-serif" font-size="10">Operator Agent</text>
                <text x="65" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a8a890" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8">PINO field inference</text>
              </g>

              <!-- Node 5: Validator & Synthesizer -->
              <g transform="translate(640, 115)">
                <rect width="105" height="70" fill="#140f0a" stroke="#ff9c1a" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <rect width="105" height="18" fill="rgba(255, 156, 26, 0.15)" />
                <text x="52" y="13" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffb84d" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600">EVALUATION</text>
                <text x="52" y="38" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0e8dc" font-family="'Sora', sans-serif" font-size="10">Validator Agent</text>
                <text x="52" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a8a890" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8">Telemetry match</text>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-void-400 text-xs font-mono mt-3 mb-0">
            ▲ High-level interaction graph demonstrating agent roles, tool interfaces, and continuous feedback control.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          3. Work Plan &amp; Milestone Schedule
        </h2>
        <div class="border border-solar/20 bg-void-950 divide-y divide-solar/15 my-6">
          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-center gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar block">PHASE 1 · WEEKS 1–3</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-void-100">Environment Setup &amp; Benchmark Scenarios</span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-400 uppercase">Completed</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-center gap-2 bg-solar/5">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar-light block">PHASE 2 · WEEKS 4–7</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-white">Agent Framework &amp; Mesh Tooling Integration</span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar uppercase font-semibold">In Progress</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-center gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-400 block">PHASE 3 · WEEKS 8–11</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-void-300">Surrogate Model Coupling &amp; Auto-Evaluation</span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-500 uppercase">Planned</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-center gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-400 block">PHASE 4 · WEEKS 12–14</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-void-300">Experimental Validation &amp; Final Report</span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-500 uppercase">Planned</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          4. Expected Deliverables
        </h2>
        <p>
          The final project submission will deliver:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-none space-y-3 pl-0 my-4 text-void-200">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-solar font-mono text-sm">◆</span>
            <span><strong>Open-Source Agent Toolkit:</strong> A modular Python library providing agent wrappers around plasma simulation tools.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-solar font-mono text-sm">◆</span>
            <span><strong>Reproducible Benchmark Suite:</strong> Standardized test geometries (radome, wingtip, pitot tube) with quantitative accuracy and compute time metrics.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-solar font-mono text-sm">◆</span>
            <span><strong>Interactive Portfolio Deck &amp; Results:</strong> Interactive web-based visualizations hosted on this portfolio site.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </article>

    <!-- ===== Navigation to Previous / Next Milestones ===== -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-solar/20" data-reveal="4">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href={resolvePath('/project/background')} class="project-nav-adjacent">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-solar">Previous Milestone // 01</span>
          <span class="font-sans font-medium text-solar-light mt-1">← Project Background</span>
        </a>

        <a href={resolvePath('/project')} class="project-nav-adjacent text-right">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-void-400">Timeline</span>
          <span class="font-sans font-medium text-void-200 mt-1">All Milestones Overview →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
